@startuml
title Dashboard Sequence Diagram

actor User
participant "UI (Dashboard Page)" as UI
participant "Store (Data Management\nuseState)" as Store
participant "Backend" as Backend

User -> UI: Open Dashboard
activate UI

UI -> Store: init state (loading, stats)
activate Store

UI -> Store: fetchStats()
Store -> Backend: GET /dashboard/stats
activate Backend

Backend --> Store: Return { monthlyRevenue, avgTransaction, topServices, trend }
deactivate Backend

Store -> Store: setStats(data)\nsetLoading(false)
Store --> UI: Update UI components with data
deactivate Store

UI --> User: Render Dashboard Cards & Charts
deactivate UI

@enduml
